{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54997","headline":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 二十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 二十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城（京本作「军」）营内，半夜忽锅鸣。\n定有暴兵来劫寨，幷（京本作「兼」）防谋反（京本作「叛」）及奸生，列阵後（京本作「远」）相迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}